---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Support & What’s Included',href:'/support/'}];
const services=[
 ['Plan','Group discovery, destination comparison, itinerary design, route and pace, accommodation, transport, activity structure, and support model.','⌖'],
 ['Coordinate','Supplier relationships, rooming assumptions, transfers, local operators, guides or instructors, timing, dependencies, and traveler information.','▣'],
 ['Prepare','Documents, insurance requirements, fitness, equipment, certification, packing, arrival details, participant questions, and final itinerary information.','✓'],
 ['Support','Defined on-trip support contacts, local supplier coordination, host or guide roles, and assistance within the agreed scope when plans change.','◎'],
 ['Extend','Pre-trip or post-trip nights, independent extensions, additional local travel, or related arrangements where practical.','↗'],
 ['Learn','After-trip feedback, organizer lessons, repeat-program improvement, and a clearer starting point for the next group departure.','☀']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Group Trip Support & What’s Included | Talon Expeditions" description="Understand how Talon Expeditions supports group trip planning, organizer coordination, travel logistics, traveler preparation, and on-trip operations, and which items vary by itinerary." image={images.packing} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.packing}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Support & What’s Included</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-services-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Supported Group Travel</p><h2>“Fully Supported” Should Explain the Work, Not Hide It</h2><p>The core planning and travel dependencies can be coordinated as one trip rather than leaving the organizer and travelers to assemble them independently. The exact scope is confirmed in the proposal and trip documents instead of being implied by a vague label.</p></div><div class="av-service-grid">{services.map((item)=><div class="av-service-card"><div class="av-service-card-icon">{item[2]}</div><h3>{item[0]}</h3><p>{item[1]}</p><a href="/plan-a-trip/">Discuss Your Trip →</a></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-proof-band" style={`background-image:url('${images.boat}')`}><div class="shell"><div class="av-proof-head"><p class="eyebrow">What Varies by Trip</p><h2>A scuba program, cruise group, cultural itinerary, and mountain trek need different operating boundaries.</h2></div><div class="av-proof-grid"><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Air Travel</h3><p>May be arranged, coordinated, or booked independently depending on the group, source markets, and itinerary.</p><small>Trip-specific scope</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Guides & Instructors</h3><p>Used where appropriate or required and provided by destination or activity specialists suited to the itinerary.</p><small>Local capability</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>On-Trip Hosting</h3><p>May be Talon-led, supplier-led, organizer-led, locally guided, or a hybrid depending on the journey.</p><small>Support model</small></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-process"><div class="shell av-process-grid"><div class="av-process-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.road}')`}><div class="av-process-callout"><h3>Support Does Not Remove Personal Responsibility</h3><p>Travelers still need to meet the documented requirements of the destination, activity, supplier, and trip.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Traveler Responsibilities</p><h2>Clear Support Includes Clear Boundaries</h2><p class="av-process-lead">Travelers remain responsible for accurate personal information, valid travel documents, required insurance, honest self-assessment of activity fit, personal equipment, and following final provider and itinerary instructions.</p><div class="av-process-topline"><strong>See trip preparation resources</strong><a href="/resources/trip-preparation/">↗</a></div><div class="av-process-steps"><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▤</div><div><h3>Documents</h3><p>Passport validity, entry eligibility, permits, and required traveler information.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">✓</div><div><h3>Readiness</h3><p>Activity expectations, fitness, prior skill, and provider prerequisites where applicable.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▣</div><div><h3>Equipment</h3><p>Personal gear, rental arrangements, packing, baggage, and specialist items.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">◎</div><div><h3>Instructions</h3><p>Final arrival, meeting, supplier, activity, and support information.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
